        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Randal Kleiser, Kyle Schickner, Peter Gallagher, Daryl Hannah, Valerie Quennessen, Brian De Palma\n- Companies: Filmways\n- Works: Grease, Summer Lovers, The Sandpiper, The Cincinnati Kid, The Fearless Vampire Killers, Ice Station Zebra, The Burning, King, Dressed to Kill, Blow Out\n- Roles: film director, producer, writer, actor, civil rights activist\n\nFacts:\n- Randal Kleiser was born on July 20, 1946, and he is an American film director and producer.\n- Randal Kleiser is best known for directing the 1978 musical romantic comedy film \"Grease.\"\n- Summer Lovers is a 1982 American romantic comedy film written and directed by Randal Kleiser.\n- Summer Lovers stars Peter Gallagher, Daryl Hannah, and Valerie Quennessen.\n- Kyle Schickner is an American film producer, writer, director, actor, and bisexual civil rights activist.\n- Filmways produced notable films including The Sandpiper, The Cincinnati Kid, The Fearless Vampire Killers, Ice Station Zebra, Summer Lovers, The Burning, King, Brian De Palma's Dressed to Kill, and Brian De Palma's Blow Out.",
